## Phase 3 instructions

1. Build both candidates as `models/<A>/predict.py` and `models/<B>/predict.py`.
2. Each needs a `notes.md` declaring its rung, parent, and expected residual character.
3. Run `skills/iterate` on each. The gate determines which (if any) goes to `final-model/`.
4. If both lose to V1 on dev CV, ship V1 with REPORT.md documenting why.

